            "Verify d20 attack roll, critical hit multiplier, and advantage roll resolution in games/crpg-realm/scripts/CombatEngine.gd",
            "Run automated D&D rules tests: python3 -m unittest games/crpg-realm/tests/test_dnd_rules.py or inspect dice formulas"
          ],
          "overview": "Master D&D 5e SRD mathematical combat resolution: d20 attack rolls vs AC, ability score modifiers floor((Stat - 10)/2), advantage/disadvantage probability curve, Nat 20 critical double damage dice, strict 6.0-second combat rounds, Action/Bonus Action/Reaction economy, and spell save DC = 8 + prof + modifier.",
          "quiz": [
            {
              "answer": "8 + Proficiency Bonus + Spellcasting Ability Modifier",
              "options": [
                "8 + Proficiency Bonus + Spellcasting Ability Modifier",
